title: authored-03-sigil-space-parity
role: specimen — the sigil space read as every reader reads it: a pair opened and closed on one line with text between stays one block pair, and a >> held in a ticked value or a quoted macrocall argument never ends the call
type: text/x-memetic-wikitext

<<~ heihei name=`x`>>the body rides here<<~/heihei>>

<<~ set note=`a >> b`>>

<<m a:"x >> y">>
